      "created_at": "2016-02-11T20:52:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would love to see variants unlocked as playable side by side.</p><p>All three Legacies battling Baron Blade together, for example.</p><p>Given that the OblivAeon plot line involves doppelgänger stroke across time and dimensional space, I think that would be a bit of awesome down the road and more economically feasible (if a bit harder to play due to lack of variety in decks) in the digital version rather than the physical one.</p>",
