      "created_at": "2016-02-11T23:27:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't think it would be quite as bad as you guys seem to think. You can't have multiple copies of Inspiring Presence, for example because it is Limited. We have been told that Limited means one copy in the game, not one copy per play area. Playing with three Legacies, I think you'd find that a lot of the cards in your hand were unplayable because some other Legacy had already played it.</p>",
